# Shell scripts must stay LF in the repository. scripts/install.sh is served
# raw over HTTPS and piped straight into sh, and a CRLF shebang fails there
# with "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M" on every Unix machine. Without this, whether
# the installer works depends on the core.autocrlf setting of whoever last
# committed it.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for anything else Unix executes directly.
*.mjs text eol=lf
